! Closure test. The data below are sigma/sigma_R from p90zr-closure.in itself
! (KD02 p+90Zr at 30 MeV, V=49.023171, W_d=7.215552), sampled every 5 degrees
! from 20 to 160 with a nominal 3 percent relative error (abserr is left F).
! The fit starts at V=42.0, W_d=9.5 and must return the two true values.
! Comments like these are safe between namelists, never inside a data block.
